sam showed direct-purchase status and this announced price on 11 september 2026. contact sam sales at 02-686-1888 or line @samline, quoting 3a0708, to confirm availability, current price and terms. original property photos display 12 march 2021. inspect current site conditions, land level, drainage, access and use.') ;
